<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells antimony ore to Aaron Ferer.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells antimony ore to Aaron Ferer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 512,742 lbs of antimony sulfide ore to Aaron Ferer &amp; Sons for an estimated provisional market value of $135,000.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
